NOTICE: This software implements parts of the ACMG/AMP 2015 variant
interpretation framework (Richards et al., Genet Med 17:405-424). It retrieves
data from ClinVar, gnomAD, Ensembl VEP and PubMed and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by any of them. Output is research evidence assembly, not a clinical
classification, and must not be used for patient care without review by a
qualified clinical genetics professional.
